🚽 untyped STDROT_EXPORT() export (legacy_int(), tests/stdrot/testabi.c)
🚽 genuinely has no statically knowable return type (return_type.type ==
🚽 STDROT_ANY, no return_like_arg -- "signature unknown" by design). For
🚽 a bare sizeof operand, get_native_call_static_type() correctly reports
